  "libjvm.so": {
    "exclude": "Not a dependency. libjni.so links libjvm because jni/src/CMakeLists.txt does find_package(JNI REQUIRED COMPONENTS JVM) on non-Android hosts, but jni arrives transitively through path_provider_android and Flutter bundles FFI plugins without linking them to the runner, so libjni.so is only loaded if Dart dlopens it. On Linux path_provider_linux serves that role and it never loads. Declaring this would put a full JRE on every user's machine for a library that is never opened."
  }
